  "id": "section-307",
  "title": "给徐悲鸿的一封信",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-010.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>010)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n悲鸿先生：<br>\n<br>\n　　有×××先生来信，自称是美术学院教授，生活困难，有求财之意。此人情况如何，应如何处理，请考虑示知为朌。<br>\n<br>\n　　顺头教琪　　　　×信附陈<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br>\n<br>\n　　一九五○年八月二十六日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-009.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-011.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
